onitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Arc(TM) Graphics (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.5768) - Intel(R) Core(TM) Ultra 5 125H (18 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nChange a vec2 uniform to instance cause the shader fail to compile.\n\nThe shader code itself means nothing, it is simplified from my real project,  tried to make it as simple as possible:\n\n```gdscript\nshader_type canvas_item;\n\ninstance uniform vec2 change_me = vec2(0.0);\n\nvec4 blend_color(vec2 uv) {\n\tvec2 pixel = uv + change_me;\n\treturn vec4(1.0);\n}\n\nvoid fragment() {\n\tCOLOR = blend_color(UV);\n}\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the minimal reproduction project, editor will print a long list of error:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/379ec70f-72c3-4394-b0c6-bf3e47a1b840)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[new_game_project_2025-02-21_11-02-05.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18898490/new_game_project_2025-02-21_11-02-05.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103108/react